   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your army must include at least 1 Canoness or Palatine who must be your Warlord.\n- Your army must include at least 2 Sisters of Battle Units.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Cult Ministorum unit.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may include 1 Cult Ministorum unit in your army for each Adeptus Sororitas unit in your army instead of per 3 units as described in the Decree Passive special rule.\n- Generate 1 additional Faith Point at the start of the First Battle Round.\n- Sister Novitiate Squads in your army gain the Acts of Faith special rule.",
