    "codex": "sisters_of_battle"
   },
   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your army must include a Canoness or Morvenn Vahl.\n- Your army must include 3 units with the Veteran Keyword.\n- If your Warlord is Slain, you lose D3 Victory Points at the end of the battle.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may field Celestians as Troops Choices.\n- You may field Seraphim as Troops choices but they gain the Support Squad special rule.\n- You may field Paragon War Suits as Elite Choices.",
